quantreg-fortran v0.1.0

This is a clean modern-Fortran translation of computational portions of the
R package quantreg 6.1. The upstream package declares "GPL (>= 2)" and this
translation is distributed under GPL-2.0-or-later.

The complete supplied upstream source is retained in original/quantreg-master
for provenance. Contributor notices and source-level attribution in that tree
remain applicable. In particular, see original/quantreg-master/README for the
Ng/Peyton sparse-Cholesky attribution requested by the original authors.

The translated FPM library does not compile or redistribute the original
cholesky.f sparse-Cholesky implementation in v0.1.0; it remains only in the
preserved original source tree.
